%% Business logic: how value flows through the domain (no infrastructure)
flowchart LR
    Matches[Match results + minutes] --> Rating[OpenElo rating<br/>mocked for now]
    Rating --> Snapshot[(Elo snapshot)]

    Trader([Trader]) -- mint / redeem --> Curve[Bonding curve<br/>price = f supply]
    Curve -- quote --> Trader
    Curve --> Ledger[(Ledger<br/>wallets + shares)]
    Curve -- fees --> Pool[Dividend pool<br/>capped by fees collected]

    Snapshot --> Dividends[Dividend calculation<br/>pegged to Elo, never to price]
    Pool --> Dividends
    Dividends -- payouts --> Ledger
